{
  "info": {
    "name": "Payment Microservice - OAuth2 Flow",
    "description": "Manual authorization_code flow against payment-authorization-server (:9000), then calls into payment-service-a (:8080) and payment-service-b (:8081).\n\nOrder of operations:\n1. Open the 'Step 1 - Authorize' request's URL in your BROWSER (not Postman Send). Log in as nithin/password, approve consent.\n2. Copy the `code` param from the browser's final redirect URL (oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback?code=...).\n3. Paste it into the collection variable `authCode` (top-right eye icon > edit, or right-click collection > Edit > Variables).\n4. Run 'Step 2 - Exchange Code for Access Token'. Its test script auto-saves the token into the `accessToken` variable.\n5. Run any request in the Service A / Service B folders - they already use {{accessToken}} as a Bearer token.\n\nAll three services must be running (scripts\\start-all.ps1).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "authServerUrl", "value": "http://localhost:9000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "serviceAUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "serviceBUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "clientId", "value": "payment-client", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "secret", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "redirectUri", "value": "https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "authCode", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "pay-postman-1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 - Sanity Checks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Discovery Document",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authServerUrl}}/.well-known/openid-configuration",
              "host": ["{{authServerUrl}}"],
              "path": [".well-known", "openid-configuration"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "JWKS",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authServerUrl}}/oauth2/jwks",
              "host": ["{{authServerUrl}}"],
              "path": ["oauth2", "jwks"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 - Manual OAuth2 Flow",
      "description": "Do these two steps first, in order. Step 1 must be opened in an actual browser tab - Postman can't render/submit the login and consent HTML forms.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Step 1 - Authorize (OPEN IN BROWSER, do not Send)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authServerUrl}}/oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id={{clientId}}&scope=payment.read payment.write&redirect_uri={{redirectUri}}",
              "host": ["{{authServerUrl}}"],
              "path": ["oauth2", "authorize"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "response_type", "value": "code" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{clientId}}" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "payment.read payment.write" },
                { "key": "redirect_uri", "value": "{{redirectUri}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Copy this request's URL (Code icon, or right-click > Copy Link) and paste it into your browser's address bar. Log in as nithin/password, tick both scopes on the consent screen, and Submit Consent. You'll land on oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback?code=... - copy everything after code= into the authCode collection variable."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Step 2 - Exchange Code for Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('token endpoint returned 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('response has access_token', () => pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "if (body.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('Saved access_token to {{accessToken}}, scope=' + body.scope);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "{{clientId}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "{{clientSecret}}", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "code", "value": "{{authCode}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "redirect_uri", "value": "{{redirectUri}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authServerUrl}}/oauth2/token",
              "host": ["{{authServerUrl}}"],
              "path": ["oauth2", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Requires authCode to be set from Step 1's browser redirect. A code only works once and expires in a few minutes - if this fails with invalid_grant, redo Step 1."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 - Service A - Payment Gateway (:8080)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paymentId\": \"{{paymentId}}\",\n  \"accountNumber\": \"acc-123\",\n  \"amount\": 50.00\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serviceAUrl}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{serviceAUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Payment By Id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serviceAUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}",
              "host": ["{{serviceAUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "{{paymentId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Payments",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serviceAUrl}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{serviceAUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 - Service B - Direct (:8081)",
      "description": "Same endpoints, called directly against the persistence service, bypassing A. Useful to confirm A's forwarded token actually reaches B.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paymentId\": \"{{paymentId}}-direct\",\n  \"accountNumber\": \"acc-123\",\n  \"amount\": 25.00\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serviceBUrl}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{serviceBUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Payment By Id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serviceBUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}-direct",
              "host": ["{{serviceBUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "{{paymentId}}-direct"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Payments",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serviceBUrl}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{serviceBUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 - Error Handling Regression Tests",
      "description": "Exercises the bug fixes made on payment-service-a/b: malformed body should be 400 (not 500), unmapped routes should be 404 (not 500).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Malformed Body -> expect 400",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns 400, not 500', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"paymentId\": \"broken\", \"accountNumber\":"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serviceAUrl}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{serviceAUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Unmapped Route -> expect 404",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns 404, not 500', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serviceAUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": ["{{serviceAUrl}}"],
              "path": ["actuator", "health"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
